menu "Spotlight Button Handler Configuration"

    config SPOTLIGHT_BUTTON_GPIO
        int "Button Input GPIO Pin"
        default 9 
        range 0 48
        help
            GPIO pin connected to the physical button (BOOT button is usually GPIO 8 or GPIO 0).

    config SPOTLIGHT_BUTTON_LONG_PRESS_MS
        int "Long Press Provisioning Hold Time (ms)"
        default 5000
        range 2000 15000
        help
            Continuous hold time in milliseconds required to trigger SoftAP provisioning mode.

endmenu
